# ── Business/personal data stays OUT of the repository (repo = Deputy's system only) ──
# Գև-ի աշխատանքային ֆայլերը (WhatsApp, xlsx, docx, օրագիր) չեն հրապարակվում։
00_Inbox/
01_Active/
02_Reference/
03_Completed/
04_Sources/
05_Archive/
Tasks.xlsx
Journal.md
Actions.md
desktop.ini

# ── Project Python runtime (rebuilt from .claude/runtime/requirements.lock) — never versioned ──
.venv/

# ── Business Operating Model: CORE (bm_*.py, schema, builder, certifier) IS versioned; the SENSITIVE OVERLAY and every
#    generated model file are local only. Mechanically enforced by .claude/policy/sensitive_scan.py (pre-commit/pre-push) ──
.claude/business/overlay/
.claude/business/*.json
.claude/business/Business-model.md

# ── Integration layer: code + fixed reader ARE versioned; generated certification/cache files are local only ──
.claude/integrations/*.json

# ── Runtime state (hardened store, audit mirror, tickets, quarantine) — never versioned ──
.claude/state/
.claude/audit/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/settings.local.json
